        "procedure": "Dy(ClO4)3·6H2O (0.3 mmol), Hdbm (0.3 mmol) and HL (0.4 mmol) were dissolved in 40 mL CH2Cl2/MeOH (v/v = 1:1). Et3N (0.7 mmol) was added with stirring. The clear yellow solution was filtered and evaporated slowly for 3 days to give yellow rod-like crystals (118 mg, 45%). The Schiff-base HL was prepared by 1:1 condensation of o-vanillin and 8-aminoquinoline in EtOH.",
