      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Complex 1 is a zero-field SMM. χMT falls from 40.64 cm3 mol−1 K at room temperature to 31.74 cm3 mol−1 K at 2 K under 1 kOe, consistent with crystal-field effects and weak intramolecular antiferromagnetic interactions. Magnetization approaches 14.83 NμB. AC data show slow relaxation dominated by Raman and QTM pathways; a shared multi-mechanism Orbach barrier of 114(7) cm−1 is reported but considered less reliable. Open hysteresis persists to 3 K, with coercive fields of about 150 Oe at 2 K and 100 Oe at 3 K.",
